# sync.between (G4 §3.3 macro) — the world ↔ workbench coordinate pairs joined by cronon:sync, in
# world order. Sync is a link between world and workbench time ONLY (a workflow/branch coordinate is
# never synced), so this is the whole "when did the commons and this bench line up" reader.
#
#!params world=default,bench=
cronon.sync.between world="$world" bench="$bench"
